        527.4344482421875,
        378.3562316894531
      ],
      "text": "authorization for delamanid for the treatment of adults (≥18 years of age) with pulmonary infections",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.11322021484375,
        527.4342651367188,
        391.5562438964844
      ],
      "text": "due to MDR-TB when an effective treatment regimen could not otherwise be devised for reasons of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.51922607421875,
        527.4375610351562,
        404.7562255859375
      ],
      "text": "(90) resistance or tolerability  . In the same year, following a WHO convened expert group meeting",
