    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.8171081542969,
        527.3837890625,
        479.2601318359375
      ],
      "text": "In 2016, given more available data on the use of delamanid in children diagnosed with MDR-TB,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.0171203613281,
        527.47265625,
        492.46014404296875
      ],
      "text": "the WHO convened another expert panel to assess new data and develop an addendum to the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.21710205078125,
        527.5245971679688,
        505.6601257324219
      ],
      "text": "2014 interim guidance on delamanid, with specific recommendations for children with MDR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.4171142578125,
        527.4047241210938,
        518.860107421875
      ],
      "text": "Based on the assessment of this evidence and recommendations from the expert panel, the WHO",
