      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.0231323242188,
        527.4760131835938,
        545.2601318359375
      ],
      "text": ",  and adolescents (6–17 years) (conditional recommendation very low confidence in estimates of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.2230834960938,
        527.38427734375,
        558.4600830078125
      ],
      "text": "(92) effect)  . The WHO interim guidance on delamanid was based on data from phase I and phase II",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.2171020507812,
        527.3860473632812,
        571.6600952148438
      ],
      "text": "clinical trials (trials 242–12–232 and 242–12–233) and the results of other earlier studies. The use of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.4171142578125,
        527.4432983398438,
        584.860107421875
      ],
      "text": "delamanid was conditionally approved by the WHO given the limited alternative treatment options",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.6171264648438,
        527.4442749023438,
        598.0601196289062
      ],
      "text": "for people with MDR-TB, on the basis that the potential benefits probably outweighed the potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.817138671875,
        527.42236328125,
        611.2601318359375
      ],
      "text": "risks. The WHO recommendations were also conditional upon longer-term effectiveness and safety",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.01708984375,
        527.3959350585938,
        624.4600830078125
      ],
      "text": "data becoming available in subsequent years, especially from phase III randomized controlled trials.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.7210693359375,
        527.5595703125,
        646.1640625
      ],
      "text": "In 2016, the WHO convened a GDG meeting where the added benefit of delamanid was re-evaluated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979129791259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.921142578125,
        527.4411010742188,
        659.3641357421875
      ],
      "text": "in conjunction with a WHO-recommended longer regimen for the treatment of MDR-TB but at that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.12109375,
        527.1051635742188,
        672.5640869140625
      ],
      "text": "time, the GDG agreed that there was not enough evidence to prompt a change in the recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.5269775390625,
        527.50146484375,
        685.7639770507812
      ],
      "text": "(93) included in the interim guidance  . In 2019, after convening a GDG meeting where newly available",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.990446090698242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.5211181640625,
        527.429931640625,
        698.964111328125
      ],
      "text": "evidence from ongoing delamanid studies was reviewed, WHO issued the consolidated guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
